Here's the basic chords of this song. I didn't even try to name the parts of this song because it
would have been too hard for me with this song. And a tip for beginners: in my opinion, you can
play all of these power chords as normal triads, such as: A5 = Am, F5 = F, G5 = G. You can try
mixing normal triads and power chords as you like. You can play the Am in the intro and verse
as Asus too, I think both are good.

